# Per-component Kconfig for the shared core component.
#
# The core carries no compile-time tunables of its own: capability
# selection lives in the project-level flags (Kconfig.projbuild), and
# runtime settings will flow through the config pool (default.toml + NVS,
# the config task's deliverable) — not through Kconfig. This file exists to
# hold the component's own symbols when the core grows a real one.
